<title>UK: Barclays repurchases 55 mln stg of bonds.</title>
<headline>Barclays repurchases 55 mln stg of bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barclays Plc has purchased for cancellation 55 million stg of its undated Floating Rate Primary Capital Notes Series 3, it said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said that 145 million stg of the notes will remain in issue.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
